<title>USA: BRC buys Pace Group.</title>
<headline>BRC buys Pace Group.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRC Holdings Inc said Friday it has completed its acquisition of Pace Group Inc, a privately-held managed care consulting firm.</p>
<p>BRC said shareholders of Pace Group received an aggregate of 432,836 shares of BRC common stock in the deal, which will be treated as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>BRC said the merger will expand its health care capabilities. It said Pace has revenues of approximately $8.5 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
